  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Discover.ConnectAsync now maintains a persistent, shared KasaDevice cache per device identity (host/port): once a device has been connected, later ConnectAsync calls for that same identity - from any caller/module, not just concurrent ones - reuse the same live KasaDevice instance instead of opening a new connection. Concurrent connect attempts are still coordinated as before. KasaDevice gained a public IsDisposed property; if the shared instance is disposed, the next ConnectAsync call for that identity detects this and transparently creates and caches a fresh replacement. No reference counting is used. No breaking API changes.",
